<</Type/StructElem/S/Figure/Alt(A clean, professional illustration showing a dental practice management system dashboard with aging buckets visualization. Display stacked horizontal bars or columns representing different time periods \(0-30 days, 31-60 days, 61-90 days, 90+ days\) with varying sizes to show receivables distribution. Use a modern healthcare color palette with blues and greens. Include visual elements like calendar icons, dollar signs, and document symbols to represent invoices and payments flowing through a system. The style should be a flat design infographic suitable for a business article, with no text or labels.)/P 108 0 R/Pg 24 0 R/K 2>>
